{
  "about": "Parity fixture for /aoide/discover (docs/discover.md). Generated by an independent reference implementation of the rules; the sidecar's DiscoverFixtureTests must reproduce every case. Scores and factors are compared to six decimals; ids, order, week and profile exactly. A case's own plays or notInterested replace the top-level ones. trackArtist, when absent, is artist.",
  "rules": {
    "week": "ISO 8601 week of now in UTC, formatted YYYY-Www; the week starts Monday 00:00 UTC",
    "history": "only plays with startedAt before the week's start are read, for the pool and for taste",
    "pool": "every track minus notInterested, minus any with a completed play, minus any started 3 or more times",
    "taste": "/aoide/next taste: best genre weight x 0.45 + artist weight x 0.3, from completed plays in the 90 days before the week's start, latest 200, each normalised against its strongest; artist is the album-artist rule; finish bias is 0",
    "order": "score descending, then shuffle ascending, then id; shuffle = lowercase hex SHA-256 of UTF-8 week:userId:trackId, compared as strings",
    "caps": "walk the order, skipping a track once 2 by its trackArtist (case-insensitive) or 3 from its album are taken; no album, no album cap",
    "profile": "events = completed plays counted for taste; since = week start minus 90 days"
  },
